# VCS Error in testbench file fc_lcc_tb_services

- Source URL: https://github.com/chipsalliance/caliptra-ss/issues/484

In the file caliptra_ss/src/integration/testbench/fc_lcc_tb_services.sv on line 34 is the statement

logic lcc_external_clk_req = 1'b0;

This signal is also used in an always block with non-blocking statements. It is also initialized there with the negedge of reset. For a least our version of VCS this is causing an error. To fix this require removing the initialization in the logic statement.

logic lcc_external_clk_req;

